{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09224","headline":"荅杨奉礼 · 韦应物","name":"荅杨奉礼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多病守山郡，自得接嘉宾。\n不见三四日，旷若十余旬。\n临觞独无味，对榻已生尘。\n一咏舟中作，洒雪忽惊新。\n烟波见栖旅，景物具昭陈。\n秋塘唯落叶，野寺不逢人。\n白事廷吏简，闲居文墨亲。\n高天池阁静，寒菊霜露频。\n应当整孤棹，归来展殷勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}